WEBVTT

00:00:57.999 --> 00:01:00.109
I am a bit more primitive,

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:02.701
like a beta version of Google Translate.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:05.337
(Laughter)

00:01:06.741 --> 00:01:10.624
My brain has the ability
to hyper-focus on things that interest me.

00:01:11.307 --> 00:01:13.974
For example, once
I had an affair with calculus

00:01:13.998 --> 00:01:16.687
that lasted longer
than some celebrity marriages.

00:01:16.711 --> 00:01:19.638
(Laughter)

00:01:20.527 --> 00:01:23.043
There are some other
unusual things about me.

00:01:24.391 --> 00:01:27.217
You may have noticed
that I don't have much inflection

00:01:27.241 --> 00:01:28.455
in my voice.

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:31.540
That's why people
often confuse me with a GPS.